WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.490
Welcome to Room Five. It belongs
to one man: Frederic Remington.

2
00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:09.880
By the 1890s, his cowboys,
cavalry troopers,

3
00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:14.010
and Native warriors filled the pages
of Harper's and other magazines.

4
00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:18.710
For millions of readers,
Remington's West simply was the West.

5
00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:20.160
In this room,

6
00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:24.640
he ties together everything you have seen
so far, and then he exports it,

7
00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:27.010
from the Plains to Cuba.

8
00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:30.190
Watch what stays the same
when the frontier moves.
